{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -c \"cat cores/bench/core.yaml && rg -n 'formal|cosim|timing' Makefile\"","aggregated_output":"name: bench\ndescription: Frozen LLM-benchmark fixture core. Identical RTL to baseline at the bench-fixture-v1\n  freeze point. The benchmark matrix clones from the bench-fixture-v1 orphan branch\n  and operates only on this directory.\nisa: rv32im\nnret: 1\ntarget_fpga: tang-nano-20k\ntargets:\n  fmax_mhz: 135\n  lut4: 10000\n  coremark_iter_s: 300\n  coremark_per_mhz: 2.2\ncurrent:\n  fmax_mhz: 47.232\n  lut4: 2827\n  ff: 728\n  coremark_iter_s: 2.0e-06\n  coremark_per_mhz: 0.0\n  source_id: hyp-20260929-003-r2s2\n  updated: '2026-09-29T10:54:11.315744Z'\n1:.PHONY: help lint test test-infra cosim formal fpga timing next loop report bench clean\n53:CORE_TARGETS := lint test cosim cosim-build formal formal-deep fpga next loop\n79:\t@echo \"  make cosim TARGET=v1    — RVFI cosim against Python ISS\"\n80:\t@echo \"  make formal TARGET=v1   — riscv-formal fast suite (with ALTOPS)\"\n81:\t@echo \"  make formal-deep TARGET=v1 — full formal suite without ALTOPS (slow, bitvector-correct)\"\n83:\t@echo \"  make timing TARGET=v1   — Gowin Fmax and worst paths (placement option 0)\"\n112:cosim: cosim-build bench/programs/selftest.elf bench/programs/coremark.elf\n113:\tpython3 -m tools.eval.cosim . $(TARGET)\n115:cosim-build: $(wildcard $(RTL_DIR)/*.sv) test/cosim/main.cpp\n116:\tbash test/cosim/build.sh\n121:formal:\n122:\tbash formal/run_all.sh formal/checks.cfg\n124:# formal-deep: same checks WITHOUT RISCV_FORMAL_ALTOPS so bitwuzla\n127:# orchestrator's per-iteration formal gate uses fast `make formal`.\n128:# See formal/checks.cfg comments for the full ALTOPS scope explanation.\n129:formal-deep:\n130:\tbash formal/run_all.sh formal/checks-deep.cfg\n135:# FPGA timing and area come from the vendor flow, Gowin EDA\n137:fpga: cosim-build bench/programs/coremark.elf\n140:timing:\n162:\t  [ -e \"$(WT_PATH)/formal/riscv-formal\" ] || ln -s \"$(CURDIR)/formal/riscv-formal\" \"$(WT_PATH)/formal/riscv-formal\"; \\\n178:\trm -rf test/cosim/sim_build sim_build out\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
