tage.sv\n    description: \"Use the registered forwarding choices for EX operand selection while retaining the existing data mux and RVFI operand values.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Check both forwarding sources, dual matches, load-use bubbles, redirects, divider holds, and dmem stalls against retirement and register results.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
