EX forwarding and ALU critical path keeps Fmax near 55 MHz, leaving this IPC gain behind EX retiming.\n- 2026-09-29 hyp-20260929-002-r6s1 (improvement, +12.11%): Registering next-cycle forwarding selects and parallel EX result and PC candidates moves tag comparisons and wide result/target muxes off the EX critical path while preserving next-cycle dependent ALU forwarding.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
