 \"Capture parallel results without a pre-register operation mux; preserve divider, redirect, and stall semantics.\"\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Forward the selected registered EX/MEM result to dependent EX instructions with the existing priority.\"\n  - file: rtl/mem_stage.sv\n    description: \"Select the registered architectural result for MEM/WB while retaining the independent effective address and RVFI fields.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Check back-to-back dependencies across ALU, shift, multiply, jump, load, and divider operations under memory stalls and redirects.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
