binational divider from core.\\nThe shorter timed EX path should raise Fmax enough to outweigh divide stalls.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 35, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a shared iterative divider, capture forwarded operands once, insert EX/MEM bubbles wh\n…[115164 of 118236 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:7e3ed0003a4a32d4]…\nion semantics.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Cover replay hits across loops longer than 16 words and across all four banks; move the existing PC 0/64 tag-collision case to PC 0/256 for the new index, and retain stall, redirect, code-store, and ordered-retirement checks.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 176.04, \"delta_pct\": -1.73, \"vs_baseline\": 1352.48, \"fmax_mhz\": 64.983, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3691312, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 5751, \"ff\": 2326, \"seeds\": [60.587, 64.983, 64.983], \"perturbations\": [[0, 60.587, 13], [1, 64.983, 8], [2, 64.983, 8]], \"lutram\": 80, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_3_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/fwd_rs2_sel_q_1_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -11.505, \"arrival_ns\": 21.799, \"logic_cells\": 16, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_hazard\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 13, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-29T14:04:04.487823Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 9}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
