e margin with essentially unchanged CoreMark cycles.\nexpected_impact:\n  fitness_delta_pct: 6\n  confidence: medium\nchanges:\n  - file: rtl/core.sv\n    description: \"Drive IF direction-table training from the registered EX/MEM valid bit, branch control, PC index, and pc_select, rather than combinational EX feedback.\"\n  - file: rtl/if_stage.sv\n    description: \"Remove the redundant training feedback registers and update the saturating counters directly from qualified EX/MEM inputs, preserving one update per surviving branch.\"\n  - file: rtl/ex_stage.sv\n    description: \"Remove the now-unused EX branch-training outputs while retaining branch comparison, correction, misalignment handling, and EX/MEM PC selection.\"\n  - file: test/test_pipeline.py\n    description: \"Exercise back-to-back taken and not-taken branches, redirect squashes, held older memory operations, and misaligned targets; check ordered RVFI retirement and correct control flow.\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
