ional divider from core.\\nThe shorter timed EX path should raise Fmax enough to outweigh divide stalls.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 35, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a shared iterative divider, capture forwarded operands once, insert EX/MEM bubbles wh\n…[118618 of 121690 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:d0787c2b3ed4de7a]…\ntaining branch comparison, correction, misalignment handling, and EX/MEM PC selection.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Exercise back-to-back taken and not-taken branches, redirect squashes, held older memory operations, and misaligned targets; check ordered RVFI retirement and correct control flow.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 195.43, \"delta_pct\": -1.32, \"vs_baseline\": 1512.46, \"fmax_mhz\": 74.693, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3821957, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 5035, \"ff\": 2281, \"seeds\": [74.347, 74.693, 74.693], \"perturbations\": [[0, 74.347, 12], [1, 74.693, 12], [2, 74.693, 12]], \"lutram\": 22, \"bsram\": 4, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_3_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_31_s1\", \"slack_ns\": -8.45, \"arrival_ns\": 18.745, \"logic_cells\": 12, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_id\", \"cpu/u_if\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 12, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-29T14:26:03.989368Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 10}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
