 the unused combinational divider from core.\\nThe shorter timed EX path should raise Fmax enough to outweigh divide stalls.\\n\", \"expected_impact\": {\"fitness_delta_pct\": 35, \"confidence\": \"medium\"}, \"changes\": [{\"file\": \"rtl/ex_stage.sv\", \"description\": \"Add a shared iterative divider, capture forwarded operands once, insert EX/MEM bubbles wh\n…[166207 of 169279 chars elided by tools/bench/transcript.py; sha256:bdf2f46ec1e24948]…\n fill, store invalidation, and collision handling.\"}, {\"file\": \"test/test_pipeline.py\", \"description\": \"Check sequential second-level hits, branch and JAL redirects, held PCs, window boundaries, same-index aliases, RAM collisions, and stores to cached instructions with exact RVFI PC and instruction order.\"}], \"outcome\": \"regression\", \"fitness\": 173.35, \"delta_pct\": -22.54, \"vs_baseline\": 1330.28, \"fmax_mhz\": 61.459, \"ipc_coremark\": 3e-06, \"cycles\": 3545276, \"iterations\": 10, \"lut4\": 6418, \"ff\": 2579, \"seeds\": [60.934, 61.459, 61.459], \"perturbations\": [[0, 60.934, 15], [1, 61.459, 15], [2, 61.459, 15]], \"lutram\": 22, \"bsram\": 5, \"dsp\": 6, \"critical_path\": {\"from\": \"cpu/u_if/pc_3_s1\", \"to\": \"cpu/u_id/reg_q.rs2_val_10_s0\", \"slack_ns\": -11.411, \"arrival_ns\": 21.706, \"logic_cells\": 30, \"modules\": [\"clock_ibuf\", \"cpu/u_if\", \"cpu/u_id\"]}, \"logic_levels\": 15, \"formal_passed\": true, \"cosim_passed\": true, \"error\": null, \"implementation_notes\": \"\", \"timestamp\": \"2026-09-29T16:55:50.494388Z\", \"slot\": 2, \"round_id\": 14}\n", "exit_code": 0, "status": "completed"}}
